<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101a2b">
  <meta name="description" content="Rahimi Solution delivers thoughtful healthcare technology and business IT solutions built around people, security, and lasting results.">
  <title>Rahimi Solution | Healthcare & Business Technology</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://images.unsplash.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.2/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #101a2b;
      --ink-soft: #1b2a40;
      --paper: #f7f8f6;
      --white: #fff;
      --muted: #627084;
      --teal: #18a999;
      --teal-dark: #087f75;
      --gold: #d7ad62;
      --line: rgba(16, 26, 43, .1);
      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(16, 26, 43, .12);
      --radius: 24px;
      --ease: cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1);
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 90px; }
    body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; line-height: 1.65; overflow-x: hidden; }
    body.menu-open { overflow: hidden; }
    img { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    button, input, textarea, select { font: inherit; }
    .container { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
    .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; color: var(--teal-dark); font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 26px; height: 2px; background: var(--teal); }
    .section { padding: 108px 0; }
    .section-heading { max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .section-heading h2 { margin: 13px 0 14px; font: 800 clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.45rem)/1.12 'Manrope', sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
    .section-heading p { max-width: 620px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .site-header { position: fixed; inset: 0 0 auto; z-index: 20; transition: background .3s, box-shadow .3s; }
    .site-header.scrolled { background: rgba(255,255,255,.92); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(16,26,43,.08); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); }
    .nav { min-height: 82px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }
    .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; text-decoration: none; font: 800 1.05rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .brand-mark { width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 14px; color: white; background: linear-gradient(145deg,var(--teal),#087c83); box-shadow: 0 9px 22px rgba(24,169,153,.25); }
    .brand small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font: 600 .65rem 'DM Sans',sans-serif; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .nav-links a { color: #435166; text-decoration: none; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600; transition: color .2s; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--teal-dark); }
    .button { display: inline-flex; min-height: 50px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; padding: 0 22px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--teal); color: white; text-decoration: none; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(24,169,153,.22); transition: transform .25s var(--ease), background .25s, box-shadow .25s; cursor: pointer; }
    .button:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); background: var(--teal-dark); box-shadow: 0 15px 32px rgba(24,169,153,.28); }
    .button-dark { background: var(--ink); box-shadow: none; }
    .button-dark:hover { background: #263b58; }
    .menu-toggle { display: none; width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 50%; background: white; color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; }

    .hero { position: relative; min-height: 740px; display: grid; align-items: center; padding: 130px 0 90px; color: white; background: var(--ink); isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero::before { position: absolute; z-index: -2; inset: 0; content: ''; background: linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(13,25,42,.96) 0%,rgba(13,25,42,.88) 45%,rgba(13,25,42,.30) 100%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=85') center 42%/cover; }
    .hero::after { position: absolute; z-index: -1; width: 560px; height: 560px; right: -170px; bottom: -240px; content: ''; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 48px rgba(255,255,255,.025), 0 0 0 100px rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; align-items: center; gap: 60px; }
    .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 650px; animation: rise-in .8s var(--ease) both; }
    .hero .eyebrow { color: #a7e7dd; }
    .hero h1 { margin: 22px 0; font: 800 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.25rem)/1.04 'Manrope',sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
    .hero h1 span { color: #8be0d4; }
    .hero-copy > p { max-width: 570px; margin: 0 0 30px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.77); font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
    .button-outline { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.42); background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); box-shadow: none; backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
    .button-outline:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
    .hero-note { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 34px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); font-size: .85rem; }
    .hero-note i { color: #8be0d4; }
    .hero-visual { position: relative; min-height: 440px; perspective: 1200px; animation: rise-in .9s .12s var(--ease) both; }
    .hero-photo { position: absolute; inset: 14px 35px 20px 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.38); border-radius: 36px; box-shadow: 0 35px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.4); transform: rotateY(-8deg) rotateX(3deg); transition: transform .6s var(--ease); }
    .hero-visual:hover .hero-photo { transform: rotateY(-2deg) rotateX(0) translateY(-8px); }
    .hero-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .hero-photo::after { position: absolute; inset: 40% 0 0; content: ''; background: linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(9,20,34,.5)); }
    .float-card { position: absolute; z-index: 2; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 15px 18px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7); border-radius: 17px; color: var(--ink); background: rgba(255,255,255,.94); box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.2); animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .float-card i { width: 40px; height: 40px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 12px; color: var(--teal-dark); background: #e4f6f2; }
    .float-card strong { display: block; font: 700 .88rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; }
    .float-card small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .72rem; }
    .float-card.one { top: 54px; left: -15px; }
    .float-card.two { right: 0; bottom: 40px; animation-delay: -2s; }

    .trust-strip { position: relative; z-index: 3; margin-top: -1px; background: white; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .trust-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); padding: 25px 0; }
    .trust-item { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: #536176; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .trust-item + .trust-item { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .trust-item i { color: var(--teal); font-size: 1.1rem; }

    .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr; align-items: center; gap: 75px; }
    .about-visual { position: relative; min-height: 470px; perspective: 1000px; }
    .about-image { position: absolute; inset: 0 38px 35px 0; overflow: hidden; border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); transform: rotateY(5deg); transition: transform .5s var(--ease); }
    .about-visual:hover .about-image { transform: rotateY(0) translateY(-5px); }
    .about-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .about-stamp { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; width: 175px; padding: 22px; border: 7px solid var(--paper); border-radius: 22px; color: white; background: var(--ink); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .about-stamp strong { display: block; color: #8be0d4; font: 800 1.8rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; }
    .about-stamp span { font-size: .82rem; }
    .about-copy h2 { margin: 14px 0 20px; font: 800 clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.3rem)/1.12 'Manrope',sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
    .about-copy > p { color: var(--muted); }
    .check-list { display: grid; gap: 14px; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 26px 0 32px; }
    .check-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; color: #37465b; font-weight: 600; }
    .check-list i { margin-top: 5px; color: var(--teal); }
    .values { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .value-card { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: white; }
    .value-card i { color: var(--teal-dark); }
    .value-card h3 { margin: 10px 0 5px; font: 700 1rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; }
    .value-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem; }

    .services { background: #edf2f2; }
    .center-heading { margin-inline: auto; text-align: center; }
    .center-heading p { margin-inline: auto; }
    .center-heading .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
    .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); gap: 22px; perspective: 1200px; }
    .service-card { position: relative; min-height: 300px; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid rgba(16,26,43,.07); border-radius: 22px; background: white; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(16,26,43,.045); transform-style: preserve-3d; transition: transform .4s var(--ease), box-shadow .4s, border-color .4s; }
    .service-card:hover { transform: translateY(-9px) rotateX(2deg) rotateY(-2deg); border-color: rgba(24,169,153,.35); box-shadow: 0 25px 55px rgba(16,26,43,.12); }
    .service-icon { width: 56px; height: 56px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 17px; color: var(--teal-dark); background: #e5f6f2; font-size: 1.35rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(24,169,153,.12); }
    .service-card h3 { margin: 23px 0 10px; font: 700 1.17rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .service-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; }
    .card-arrow { position: absolute; right: 28px; bottom: 27px; color: var(--teal-dark); transition: transform .25s; }
    .service-card:hover .card-arrow { transform: translateX(5px); }

    .feature-band { position: relative; color: white; background: var(--ink); overflow: hidden; }
    .feature-band::before { position: absolute; top: -220px; right: -90px; width: 500px; height: 500px; content: ''; border: 1px solid rgba(139,224,212,.18); border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 55px rgba(139,224,212,.03), 0 0 0 110px rgba(139,224,212,.025); }
    .feature-grid { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
    .feature-copy h2 { margin: 15px 0; font: 800 clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.2rem)/1.12 'Manrope',sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .feature-copy p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.68); }
    .feature-copy .eyebrow { color: #8be0d4; }
    .feature-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; }
    .feature-item { min-height: 145px; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13); border-radius: 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.055); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); transition: transform .3s, background .3s; }
    .feature-item:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
    .feature-item i { color: #8be0d4; font-size: 1.25rem; }
    .feature-item h3 { margin: 12px 0 4px; font: 700 .98rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; }
    .feature-item p { margin: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,.63); font-size: .82rem; }

    .industries-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .industry { min-height: 190px; padding: 26px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; background: white; text-align: center; transition: transform .3s var(--ease), box-shadow .3s; }
    .industry:hover { transform: translateY(-7px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .industry i { display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--teal-dark); font-size: 1.8rem; }
    .industry h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font: 700 1rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; }
    .industry p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }

    .contact { background: #edf2f2; }
    .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; align-items: start; gap: 65px; }
    .contact-copy h2 { margin: 15px 0; font: 800 clamp(2.2rem,4vw,3.3rem)/1.1 'Manrope',sans-serif; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
    .contact-copy > p { color: var(--muted); }
    .contact-note { margin-top: 30px; padding: 20px; border-left: 3px solid var(--teal); border-radius: 0 14px 14px 0; background: white; color: #526176; font-size: .9rem; }
    .contact-form { padding: 34px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; background: white; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(16,26,43,.07); }
    .form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .field { margin-bottom: 17px; }
    .field label { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; color: #38465a; font-size: .83rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .field input, .field textarea, .field select { width: 100%; padding: 13px 14px; border: 1px solid #dfe5e9; border-radius: 11px; outline: none; color: var(--ink); background: #fbfcfc; transition: border-color .2s, box-shadow .2s; }
    .field input:focus, .field textarea:focus, .field select:focus { border-color: var(--teal); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(24,169,153,.12); }
    .field textarea { min-height: 120px; resize: vertical; }
    .form-status { min-height: 24px; margin: 12px 0 0; color: var(--teal-dark); font-size: .9rem; }

    .footer { padding: 66px 0 25px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); background: #0c1421; }
    .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 50px; padding-bottom: 45px; }
    .footer .brand { color: white; }
    .footer-about p { max-width: 370px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.58); font-size: .9rem; }
    .footer h3 { margin: 0 0 15px; color: white; font: 700 .95rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; }
    .footer-links { display: grid; align-content: start; gap: 10px; }
    .footer-links a { width: fit-content; color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); font-size: .88rem; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #8be0d4; }
    .footer-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding-top: 22px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); color: rgba(255,255,255,.45); font-size: .8rem; }
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); transition: opacity .7s var(--ease), transform .7s var(--ease); }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    @keyframes rise-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    @keyframes float { 0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-10px); } }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .nav-links { gap: 18px; }
      .nav > .button { display: none; }
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr  .8fr; gap: 25px; }
      .hero-visual { min-height: 370px; }
      .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
      .about-grid, .feature-grid, .contact-grid { gap: 42px; }
      .industries-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .container { width: min(100% - 36px, 560px); }
      .section { padding: 76px 0; }
      .nav { min-height: 72px; }
      .menu-toggle { display: grid; place-items: center; z-index: 22; }
      .nav-links { position: fixed; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; justify-content: center; gap: 22px; padding: 90px 36px 36px; background: rgba(247,248,246,.98); opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transform: translateY(-10px); transition: .25s; }
      .nav-links.open { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: none; }
      .nav-links a { display: block; font: 700 1.5rem 'Manrope',sans-serif; }
      .hero { min-height: auto; padding: 120px 0 65px; }
      .hero::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(13,25,42,.94),rgba(13,25,42,.78)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80') center/cover; }
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 26px; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.9rem,12vw,4.4rem); }
      .hero-copy > p { font-size: 1rem; }
      .hero-visual { min-height: 300px; margin: 0 5px; }
      .hero-photo { inset: 4px 20px 12px 12px; border-radius: 25px; }
      .float-card.one { top: 25px; left: -5px; }
      .float-card.two { right: -5px; bottom: 20px; }
      .trust-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; row-gap: 18px; padding: 23px 0; }
      .trust-item { justify-content: flex-start; font-size: .76rem; }
      .trust-item + .trust-item { border: 0; }
      .about-grid, .feature-grid, .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-visual { min-height: 340px; order: 2; }
      .about-image { inset: 0 25px 25px 0; }
      .about-copy { order: 1; }
      .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .service-card { min-height: 250px; }
      .feature-list { gap: 10px; }
      .feature-item { min-height: 138px; padding: 18px; }
      .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
      .contact-form { padding: 24px 19px; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; }
      .footer-about { grid-column: 1/-1; }
      .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 390px) {
      .hero-actions .button { width: 100%; }
      .values, .feature-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .industries-grid { gap: 10px; }
      .industry { padding: 22px 12px; }
      .float-card { padding: 10px 12px; }
      .float-card i { width: 34px; height: 34px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; animation-duration: .01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
      .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header" id="siteHeader">
    <nav class="nav container" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="Rahimi Solution home">
        <span class="brand-mark"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></span>
        <span>Rahimi Solution<small>Technology with purpose</small></span>
      </a>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#industries">Industries</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="button" href="#contact">Let’s talk <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
      <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navLinks"><i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i></button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">Healthcare & business IT</span>
          <h1>Better technology.<br><span>Better outcomes.</span></h1>
          <p>We help healthcare organizations and growing businesses work smarter with secure, reliable technology designed around the people who use it.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button" href="#services">Explore our services <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
            <a class="button button-outline" href="#about">Get to know us</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Practical expertise. People-first partnership.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Healthcare professional using digital technology">
          <div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Healthcare professionals collaborating around a digital tablet" fetchpriority="high"></div>
          <div class="float-card one"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart"></i><span><strong>People first</strong><small>Technology that supports care</small></span></div>
          <div class="float-card two"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i><span><strong>Secure by design</strong><small>Built for confidence</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="trust-strip" aria-label="Our approach">
      <div class="container trust-inner">
        <div class="trust-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i> Healthcare focused</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Security minded</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i> Partner-led</div>
        <div class="trust-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i> Built for what’s next</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section" id="about">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div class="about-visual reveal">
          <div class="about-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="A team working together on a technology project" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="about-stamp"><strong>One team.</strong><span>Technology and people moving forward together.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-copy reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
          <h2>Technology should make work feel easier.</h2>
